#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Discounts &amp; Loyalty Programmes matter:</strong> Incentivize "
"clients to return to your\n"
"                    store"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pentingnya Diskon &amp; Program Loyalitas:</strong> Berikan insentif "
"kepada pelanggan agar mau kembali ke\n"
"                    toko Anda"

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Odoo</strong> helps clothing stores create a smoother, more "
"connected retail experience from the shop\n"
"            floor to the back office. Whether you run a store, a growing "
"fashion brand, or a multi-location retail\n"
"            business, Odoo brings your daily operations together so you can "
"spend less time juggling tools and more time\n"
"            focusing on your customers, your collections, and your growth."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Odoo</strong> membantu toko baju menghadirkan pengalaman ritel yang "
"lebih lancar dan terintegrasi, mulai dari\n"
"            shop floor hingga bagian administrasi. Baik untuk pemilik toko, "
"brand fashion yang sedang berkembang, atau bisnis ritel\n"
"            dengan banyak lokasi, Odoo menggabungkan operasional harian Anda "
"agar Anda lebih hemat waktu dalam\n"
"            mengatur berbagai alat dan lebih fokus pada pelanggan, koleksi, "
"dan pertumbuhan bisnis."

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Payment Terminals</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Terminal Pembayaran</strong>"

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Tags </strong>can be used to categorize your products: a clothing "
"item can be part of both the\n"
"            summer collection, the discounts section, and the accessories "
"section, for example."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Tag </strong>dapat digunakan untuk mengategorikan produk: suatu "
"pakaian dapat termasuk dalam\n"
"            koleksi musim panas, bagian diskon, dan bagian aksesori, "
"misalnya."

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Use automatic reordering rules:</strong> to keep stock levels where "
"they should be"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Gunakan aturan order ulang otomatis:</strong> untuk menjaga tingkat "
"stok tetap sesuai dengan yang seharusnya"

